# What Thot ships but did not write. These are the skill and MCP libraries
# ported from Hermes Agent: third-party documentation with example scripts
# inside. Auditing them does not produce findings about Thot, it produces
# noise that hides them.
#
# `thot skills scan` is the right tool for this content — it asks whether a
# skill is safe to trust, which is the question these files actually pose.
skills/
optional-skills/
mcp-catalog/

# Deliberately broken code, kept broken on purpose.
tests/fixtures/

# Les deux programmes fusionnés. Ce sont des projets complets avec leur propre
# audit, pas du code de Thot : les balayer au démarrage ferait passer chaque
# lancement de 1 s à 100 s, et noierait les findings de Thot sous les 365 de
# Hermes. Les auditer est un acte explicite :
#   thot audit hermes
#   thot audit prime
hermes/
prime/
